      "text": "The Main Building store remains open 7 a.m.–11 p.m. during recess, while the Engineering store operates 9 a.m.–6 p.m.; its cafe and dining area continue through summer. Holiday and exam-period hours require official notices. Guidance may provide posted locations and hours or same-type alternatives, but cannot verify inventory, payment, sudden closures, purchases, ATM errors, unlisted ingredients, or cross-contact. Keep Main Building and West Complex ATMs distinct and refer service issues to the relevant posted contact or operator."
